{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qqZhyaffrb1794454207.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>啟德體育園明日起一連多日舉行演唱會，運輸署提醒內地旅客，切勿乘坐非法「白牌車」過關。</p><p></p><p>署方指已與港鐵協調，加密屯馬綫班次，以便內地旅客即日往返，呼籲旅客盡量使用羅湖站過關，亦建議乘搭跨境巴士，但提醒要預先在網上平台買票，現場不設售票。</p><p></p><p>署方指，若旅客乘搭跨境出租車，要留意擋風玻璃左邊及車尾，會貼有「過境出租車」標誌及相關的車輛編號，若乘搭非法跨境出租車，第三者保險或失效，乘客有一定風險。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:24:06.710678+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T03:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T14:37:16.716480+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:17:14.348812+00:00","content_hash":"1f6534bf291810b21e57587a265ebdbc992ca363dc364c43c7ccf97e33126e33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:24:06.710678+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}